OL,3,GNEWSAMonkey dust operation sees more
OL,4,Athan 30 arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 arrests and 25kg (55lb) of
OL,7,Fsuspected monkey dust has been seized
OL,8,Fin Staffordshire following a police
OL,9,Foperation.
OL,11,FVehicles, weapons and cash have also
OL,12,Fbeen confiscated as part of the
OL,13,Fsix-month Operation Rivent, according
OL,14,Fto Staffordshire Police.
OL,16,FThe focussed work led to 138 reports
OL,17,Flinked to monkey dust, a synthetic
OL,18,Fclass B drug, in the county with
OL,19,F"around 35 arrests" made in
OL,20,FStoke-on-Trent and Stafford.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
